# Supabase project holding the Ttareungi (따릉이) OD + station tables that feed the
# particle trips (src/data/bikeTrips.ts). Copy to .env.local and fill in. Use the
# anon / publishable key only — never service_role. Without these the particles
# fall back to random trips.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
